hange the boldness italics  it's like pretty standard stuff but you  can also change the color of the font  you can also change the highlight  you can also turn this into there's an  option for a quote  and of course if you want to undo this  you just reset to default  one way to keep all of your blog posts  organized is through categories and tags  so i've created a category um  personal  travel architecture and career  and so i can just select this category  and once i publish it  under that category  [Music]  so once i put it in that category i just  click into the category and then i'll  see my blog post  yeah the other thing that i really love  is that um let's say i had a series of  videos  in the thumbnail of the blog post you  can actually see a little preview of the  video  so let's say i populate this entire  page with posts of my videos i'll have  all of these moving thumbnails the  platform is very very customizable and  you can basically use it just like in  design so  you put an image in  and you can  customize it you can adjust it the way  you want right in the viewer  so i mean this is already an edited  image but if i just put in an unedited  image then  you can probably do like an auto enhance  and this part is actually really  cool you can change the brightness  bump up the contrast and highlights  and yeah i have played around with these  tools and they're actually quite nice  uh you can put in filters  like there's just so many different  options on um editing the image within  the wix platform  and this just cuts out a really big part  of the process because typically you  would have to go into photoshop or  illustrator or indesign and edit the  image or crop the image and then save it  as a jpeg and bring and then bring it  into your blog post but um in this case  you can edit it directly in the photo  studio here  and you can also add text  in directly into the images  that is a terrible font but uh  let's change that  let's say i want to put in captions  right directly on the image then i can  kind of do that directly in this editor  without having to go into indesign and  placing the text and exporting it as a  jpeg it just cuts out so much of the  work  and you can also  this is crazy you can also add a  freaking lens flare  how awesome is that  okay so i'm just gonna add the original  image so that you can see the comparison  okay  yeah this actually looks quite a lot  better  so yeah their photo editor is kind of  really great because it  basically cuts out the whole like  post-production  process  and  cuts out the need to use a whole  different set of programs so and they  have like presets and filters in there  that's kind of designed to make your  images look really good  so yeah that's pretty cool  and  once you gain um  a sizable following you can there's also  an option to monetize your blog post  i mean of course i would suggest  doing this once you have kind of a  sizable following  but yeah this is an option that's  directly embedded in their  toolbox  so yeah this is pretty cool so basically  it allows you to create um let's say you  have exclusive content  um it creates a paywall around that  content so that you can still have your  public content that you put out for free  but  for those special videos or special  articles you can put up a paywall so  that only people who have a membership  can access that content  so yeah  you can do a free plan  um like a one-time payment or you can  have an option to do a recurring payment  and yeah just like lots of ways to  customize the fee structure  and yeah i  really really enjoy using wix it's very  intuitive you can kind of lay things out  graphically without going into the back  end and learning how to use code and  i've used a lot of website builders in  my life i  had a vlog  since i was like 16 years old um so  that's more than 10 years i have not  found a platform that was as intuitive  and  [Music]  straightforward and just like very  visual so i think this is a great  platform for people who want a high  level of control but don't wanna  actually like  spend the time to actually learn how to  make a website  um and for people who are kind of like  picky about the way things look i really  like using it and um i think you guys  will like it too  if you guys found this video helpful hit  that like button and leave me a comment  um you know how much that helps with the  algorithm  if you want to check out my other videos  on the whole  job application process i have a video  on how to design your architectural  portfolio  i have one on how to put that portfolio  online  i also have some free templates um so  yeah check it out i'll leave it in the  end cards thanks a lot for watching guys  see you next time bye  [Applause]  [Music]

